load_count":3059,"early_load":false,"requires_patching":false,"api":false,"mod_id":"arram.fancy-player","gd":{"win":"2.2081","android32":"2.2081","android64":"2.2081","mac-intel":"2.2081","mac-arm":"2.2081","ios":"2.2081"},"status":"accepted","created_at":"2026-03-10T03:59:49Z","updated_at":"2026-03-10T03:59:49Z"},{"name":"Fancy Player","description":"Now you can be extra","version":"1.2.0","download_link":"https://api.geode-sdk.org/v1/mods/arram.fancy-player/versions/1.2.0/download","hash":"c0583d3695c00bc0147367dca528381ae50417321a17e318345b4439dcc8785c","geode":"5.3.0","download_count":8336,"early_load":false,"requires_patching":false,"api":false,"mod_id":"arram.fancy-player","gd":{"win":"2.2081","android32":"2.2081","android64":"2.2081","mac-intel":"2.2081","mac-arm":"2.2081","ios":"2.2081"},"status":"accepted","created_at":"2026-03-03T20:01:59Z","updated_at":"2026-03-03T20:01:59Z"},{"name":"Fancy Player","description":"Now you can be extra","version":"1.1.7","download_link":"https://api.geode-sdk.org/v1/mods/arram.fancy-player/versions/1.1.7/download","hash":"5d664e945eb62da100244ab62e20e1dbbb5f94a31d81c6596cc842b532c8c852","geode":"5.1.0","download_count":7350,"early_load":false,"requires_patching":false,"api":false,"mod_id":"arram.fancy-player","gd":{"win":"2.2081","android32":"2.2081","android64":"2.2081","mac-intel":"2.2081","mac-arm":"2.2081","ios":"2.2081"},"status":"accepted","created_at":"2026-02-16T06:26:51Z","updated_at":"2026-02-28T00:37:42Z"}],"tags":["gameplay","offline","enhancement","customization"],"about":"# <cy>Fancy Player</c>\r\n\r\nThis mod allows you to color and configure the decorative player effects, overriding the game's default colors and configuration. Everything is inside the mod settings.\r\n\r\n## <cr>Main Features</c>\r\n\r\n- Override startColor and finishColor of player particles\r\n- Override the color of the dash fire\r\n- Override the color of the spider dash effect\r\n- Override the color of the player streak\r\n- Fading rainbow effect can be applied to all of the above\r\n    - Adjustable rainbow fade speed\r\n- Separate dual settings for all of the above\r\n- Way too much streak customization\r\n    - Override Streak length\r\n    - Override Streak width\r\n    - Override streak image repetition\r\n    - Option to disable additive blending\r\n\r\n## <cr>Miscellaneous Features</c>\r\n\r\n- Option to scale radius emitters' maxRadius with player size\r\n- Option to align particles vertically to player when airborne\r\n- Option to align streak to player when airborne\r\n    - Option to better align streak to wave\r\n- Option to make the ship fires bigger\r\n- Button in garage for easy access to mod settings\r\n- Button in pause menu for even easier access to mod settings\r\n- Mod Menu themes under Geode mod settings","changelog":"# 1.3.4\r\n- Added \"big ship fire\" option for fun\r\n- Fixed Mega Hack's Frame Extrapolation breaking alignment options\r\n- Made menu pagenumber save with session to make fine-tuning less annoying\r\n\r\n# 1.3.1\r\n- Added color to the mod's description text (wooowwww)\r\n- Changed some default settings (default colors are still mine loool)\r\n- Changed some labels' fonts in the menu for consistency\r\n- Removed the old message in the Geode settings menu\r\n\r\n# 1.3.0\r\n- Added custom settings menu with themes\r\n- Added button to pause menu with live updates\r\n- Added \"align particles\" option (you most likely won't use this)\r\n- Added a TON of streak customization\r\n- Fixed a bug with spider dash coloring\r\n- Cut RGB fade speed in half because it was too fast\r\n\r\n# 1.2.0\r\n- Added separated customization for dual gamemode\r\n- Added spider dash effect color customization\r\n- Added coloring to the rest of the player ground particles\r\n- Improved settings menu\r\n\r\n# 1.1.7\r\n- Added mod button to garage for easier access to mod settings\r\n\r\n# 1.1.0\r\n- Added fading rainbow options for particles and dash fire\r\n\r\n# 1.0.0\r\n- Mod exists!","created_at":"2026-02-28T01:38:11Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T23:33:19Z","links":{"community":null,"homepage":null,"source":"https://github.com/ArramEgg/Fancy-Player"}}